# NOTE: the two saved-variable names above deliberately keep the old, unprefixed
# spelling. They are invisible to users, and renaming them would have thrown away
# every existing profile: WoW stores saved variables in a file named after the addon
# folder, so the rename already forced those files to be copied across, and changing
# the variable names inside them as well would have left nothing to restore.
